{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-beach-walk-residence-2","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"beach-walk-residence-2-imtiaz-developments-dubai-islands","about":"Beach Walk Residence 2 is an elite 8-storey residential complex on the seafront in the Dubai Islands, offering cozy and spacious apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. Inspired by resort living, Beach Walk Residence 2 boasts a harmonious mix of neutral colors with hints of turquoise and luxurious touches of gold. Every corner is designed to provide unparalleled comfort and satisfaction to all needs. The daily reality at Beach Walk Residence 2, a masterpiece by Imtiaz Developments, is to wake up to the gentle sound of waves and the sun-drenched sand is just a few minutes' leisurely stroll away.Future residents will have access to amenities such as a fully equipped kitchen with Miele appliances, a smart home system, zen gardens and swimming pools, a children's playground, an indoor and outdoor gym, a clubhouse, parking and charging for electric vehicles, and a barbecue area.The complex is strategically located and allows quick access to the city center and major attractions, including Nakheel Mall - 2 minutes, Waterfront Market - 5 minutes, nearest metro station - 8 minutes, Dubai International Airport - 10 minutes, Jumeirah Mosque - 20 minutes and others.Whether you're looking for a serene retreat or an investment opportunity in one of Dubai's most sought-after areas, Beach Walk Residence 2 offers the perfect balance of luxury and practicality.EOI: 100 000 AEDLaunch date: will be announced later","price":2079833,"title":"Beach Walk Residence 2","bitrix":{"id":729,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Beach Walk Residence 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Beach Walk Residence 2","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Imtiaz Developments","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr